<title>USA: Coca-Cola Bottling buys own shares.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Bottling buys own shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Bottling Co Consolidated on Tuesday said it bought 145,260 shares of its common stock in a private transaction with a single shareholder at $47.50 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it also planned to negotiate with Coca-Cola Co over the purchase of about 275,000 common shares of Coca-Cola Co.</p>
<p>It said any purchase would be part a contractual arrangement in which it bought enough shares to maintain a 29.67 percent stake in Coca-Cola Co.</p>
<p>However, it said it had &quot;no immediate plans to purchase additional shares&quot; in Coca-Cola Co.</p>
</text>
